Id: pass016w
Severity: WARN
Category: accounts
Check: check_passwd
Fix: Give the account a home directory of its own (usermod -d), or /nonexistent.
References: usermod(8)
Controls: CIS 5.1, 5.2; NIST AC-2, IA-5(1); ISO 5.16, 5.17; CE User access control

The listed login ID should not have "/" (system root directory)
as its home drive. This is a possible security hole.
